{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemespacesemantictokensprovider\/fixedxlarge"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Semantic token used for extra large constant and invariant spacings, independent of the breakpoint."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To be used as auto-layout variables to delineate areas or build different elements (cards, push, carousel)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike scaled tokens, it is possible to change references between different breakpoints."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token DimensionRawTokens._400 (= 32)"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"fixedXlarge","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B32ThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProviderC11fixedXlargeSdvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fixedXlarge"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic05SpaceB5Tokena","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SpaceSemanticToken"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProvider\/fixedXlarge"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fixedXlarge","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpaceSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic05Spac